{
  "job_B8.1.4.2_20251003_114807": {
    "chunk_text": "swarode Farao & cw\u00e6\u00f0: Hu mage ge \u00f0\u00e6s frymdige beon, ge \u00f0e mine \u00f0eowas syndon, \u00f0\u00e6t ge Hig ne m\u00e6g na swa beon, ac ceosa\u00f0 swa fela manna of eowrum cynne swa ge willon, \u00fe\u00e6t eowrum Witodlice Drihten cw\u00e6\u00f0 to Moyse: Ahefe \u00feine hand ofer Egypta land, \u00fe\u00e6t g\u00e6rstapan cumon & & Moyses ahof up hys gyrde ofer Egypta land, & Drihten dyde \u00f0\u00e6t \u00f0\u00e6r bleow byrnende wynd ealne \u00dea foron ofer eall Egypta land, swilce n\u00e6fre \u00e6r \u00f0\u00e6re tide n\u00e6ron, ne \u00e6fter towearde ne synd. Witodlice hi fr\u00e6ton eal \u00f0\u00e6t se hagol \u00e6r l\u00e6fde, \u00fe\u00e6t nan \u00f0ing n\u00e6s grenes l\u00e6fed, ne on g\u00e6rse ne on For \u00f0am \u00f0ingon clypode Pharao hr\u00e6dlice Moyses & Aaron, & cw\u00e6\u00f0 to him: Ic agylte wi\u00f0 eowerne Ac forgyfa\u00f0 me minne gylt nu \u00e6t \u00f0isum cyrre, & bidda\u00f0 eowerne God \u00fe\u00e6t he adrife \u00feysne dea\u00f0 & he eode ut fram Faraone & geb\u00e6d hine to Drihtne. \u00dea asende God wind fram westd\u00e6le & awearp \u00f0a g\u00e6rstapan on \u00f0a Readan S\u00e6, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00f0\u00e6r ne wear\u00f0 & Drihten ahyrde Faraones heortan, & he ne forlet Israhela bearn. So\u00f0lice Drihten cw\u00e6\u00f0 to Moyse: Ahefe up \u00feine hand \u00fe\u00e6t \u00f0ystru cuman ofer eal Egypta land swa & Moyses ahof up hys hand & egeslice \u00f0ystru w\u00e6ron gewordene on eallum Egypta lande. \u00de\u00e6t nan man ne geseah",
